### 3. Better “Mark as Read” for Messages

We already mark as read when you open the message.  
Let’s also add a manual toggle.

Add this route:

```php
Route::patch('messages/{message}/toggle-read', [ContactMessageController::class, 'toggleRead'])
    ->name('messages.toggle-read');
```

Add method in `ContactMessageController`:

```php
public function toggleRead(ContactMessage $message)
{
    $message->update(['is_read' => !$message->is_read]);

    return back()->with('success', 'Message status updated.');
}
